<title>USA: Homestake, Santa Fe merger clears review.</title>
<headline>Homestake, Santa Fe merger clears review.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANSISCO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Homestake Mining Co said on Tuesday that its pending acquisition of Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp has cleared government antitrust review.</p>
<p>The company said that the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act has expired without a request for additional information.</p>
</text>
